    "_comment": "DATAQUALITY · Null/NaN boolean classifiers. Single-condition classifiers emit the reserved sentinel for the out-of-scope case (a nan row under IsNull -> NAN(254); a null row under IsNan -> NULL(255)); IsNullOrNan / IsNotNullNorNan fold both into a plain true/false (no sentinels). Every test is a pub->tfr->sub chain over dq_src (DataGenSrc) / dq_ops (@transformer with on_tables=[DataQuality]) / dq_sink (TrashDest): the transformer passes its input through and carries the data-quality action under test, the server applies it to the output tables (rewriting in place and/or registering derived tables), and the subscriber asserts each resulting table matches its authored expected frame (see functions/_harness.py). Generated by gen_suites.py."
